WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.360
(light playful music)

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:04.340
- Previously, when I was in IT,

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:08.330
I was in an environment
where we have computers

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:11.510
and air condition, and I, you know,
I have to dress up very well.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.640
Now, look, I'm in the sea,

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:18.400
where, you know, you really feel one with nature.

00:00:26.895 --> 00:00:29.195
My name is Malcolm Ong,
and I'm a fish farmer.

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:34.670
I started my career 21 years ago in IT,

00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:37.190
but, actually, my love is in the sea.

00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:41.080
I got to know many farmers,

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.010
and the farmers shared their
life with me, their passion,

00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:46.880
and they influenced me,

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:49.700
and I decided that I
wanted to be a farmer.

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:57.740
When I entered into this
industry I thought to myself

00:00:57.740 --> 00:01:01.110
that, "Hey, this is a opportunity to apply

00:01:01.110 --> 00:01:03.240
"my engineering principles to farming."

00:01:04.810 --> 00:01:09.300
For instance, when we bring in
fish fries from the hatchery

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:13.280
we have to count the fish
and also check the fish.

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:17.300
Now previously, all this was done
by estimation and by hand,

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:20.230
but now we use a camera system

00:01:20.230 --> 00:01:23.350
to count the fish as they go past.

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:25.480
We can then also slow down the image,

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:27.480
and then we can check the fish, as well.

00:01:28.654 --> 00:01:30.570
(water splashing)

00:01:30.570 --> 00:01:33.900
I sell my fish to
supermarkets, wholesalers,

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:38.750
and restaurants in Singapore;
one of them is Candlenut,

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:41.200
which is a Michelin-star
restaurant in Singapore.

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:45.490
Our reputation is that we grow fish

00:01:45.490 --> 00:01:48.040
in as natural a way as possible,

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:51.040
and that's why people like to buy from us.

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:55.090
When I first got into this industry,

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:58.230
nobody believed that we would make it,

00:01:58.230 --> 00:02:02.660
but yet, we're able to come
in, and we made an impact.

00:02:02.660 --> 00:02:06.380
And I hope that I set
an example for others,

00:02:06.380 --> 00:02:09.410
so that they will be encouraged
to pursue their passion.

